  "remarks": "Abdul Rahim Hamdan Daglo was sanctioned by the UN on 24/02/2026 on the following ground:\n\nListed pursuant to paragraph 3(c) of UN Security Council Resolution 1591 (2005). As a Lieutenant General and Deputy commander of the RSF, DAGLO is an individual who impedes the peace process, constitutes a threat to stability in Darfur and the region and has committed violations of international humanitarian or human rights law or other atrocities.",
